 yellow cards followed for Joel Bertolissio and Patrick Wood as the contest moved toward its inevitable conclusion: a penalty shootout. From the spot, nerves were tested to the limit. Benjamin Garuccio , Rhyan Grant , Victor Campuzano , and Rhys Youlley all converted their penalties with composure. For the Newcastle Jets , Ben Gibson and Kota Mizunuma also found the mark. However, the shootout saw significant misses from Xavier Bertoncello , Kostandinos Grozos , and Joe Lolley , bringing a marathon encounter to an end after a night of relentless football action."
